 by gut microbiota dysbiosis, chronic low-grade inflammation, and disruption of immunometabolic homeostasis.", "char_spans": [0, 158], "extractor": "FineTuned-DistilBERT", "supporting_extractors": ["FineTuned-DistilBERT"], "confidence": 0.7401701807975769, "predictions": [{"extractor": "FineTuned-DistilBERT", "confidence": 0.7401701807975769, "polarity": "mixed_or_unclear", "language_status": "affirmed", "reasoning": "DistilBERT argmax=CAUSE_E2_E1 p=0.740"}]}, {"evidence_key": "PMID:42415555:s01", "pair_id": "PMID:42415555:s01:p01", "doc_id": "PMID:42415555", "sent_id": "PMID:42415555:s01", "pmid": "42415555", "url": "https://europepmc.org/article/MED/42415555", "sentence_text": "Pediatric obesity is a growing global concern because it leads to an increased prevalence of abnormal glucose metabolism, including dysglycemia, prediabetes, and type 2 diabetes.", "char_spans": [10, 156], "extractor": "FineTuned-DistilBERT", "supporting_extractors": ["FineTuned-DistilBERT"], "confidence": 0.8291, "predictions": [{"extractor": "FineTuned-DistilBERT", "confidence": 0.7246341705322266, "polarity": "mixed_or_unclear", "language_status": "affirmed", "reasoning": "DistilBERT argmax=CAUSE_E1_E2 p=0.725"}, {"extractor": "FineTuned-DistilBERT", "confidence": 0.9335139989852905, "polarity": "mixed_or_unclear", "language_status": "affirmed", "reasoning": "DistilBERT argmax=CAUSE_E1_E2 p=0.934"}]}]</data>
